This extension adds Stellar Blade modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#ea9999]This game does not support symlinks. You must have the mod staging folder and the game on the same drive to use this extension.[/color][/b][/size]

[size=3][b][color=#f9cb9c]UE4SS LogicMod (Blueprint) Mod Authors - You MUST include a "LogicMods" folder above your .pak file in order for this extension to install the mod to the correct location. Without this, there is no way to differentiate between LogicMod paks and regular pak mods.[/color][/b][/size]

[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs UE4SS Script-LogicMod Combo mod with both a "Content" and a "Binaries" folder to the "SB" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS LogicMods (Blueprint) mod with a "LogicMods" folder to the "SB\Content\Paks" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS mod with a "dwmapi.dll" file to the "SB\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS Script mod with a ".lua" file and a "Scripts" folder to the "SB\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS DLL mod with a ".dll" file and a "dlls" folder to the "SB\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE Sortable Pak mod with a ".pak" file.[/*]
[*]Installs Root Game Folder mod with a top-level folder such as "SB", "Engine" or "Content" to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs Config mod with a config file such as "engine.ini" or "game.ini" to the "LOCALAPPDATA\SB\Saved\Config\WindowsNoEditor" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Saves mod with a ".sav" file.[/*]
[*]Installs Menu Mod (.bk2/.webm) mod with a file or folder named "menu" and a file with one of these extensions: ".bk2" or ".webm" to the "SB\Content\Movies\Menu" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Movie Mod (.bk2) mod with a file with the ".bk2" extension to the "SB\Content\Movies" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Splash Screen mod with a file or folder named "splash.bmp" to the "SB\Content\Splash" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs CNS JSON mod with a file with the ".json" extension to the "SB\Content\Paks\~mods\CustomNanosuitSystem" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Binaries (Engine Injector) mod with anything unrecognised with no pak file to the "SB\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[*]Archives with a FOMOD installer (a "fomod" folder with ModuleConfig.xml) are handed to Vortex's built-in FOMOD installer instead.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

